            "line": 301,
            "text": "theorem expTilt_variance (m d μ p : ℝ) :\n    angularMean (fun θ => (expTilt m d μ p θ - m) ^ 2) =\n      (d / p) ^ 2 * (expNormalizer (2 * (μ * p)) / expNormalizer (μ * p) ^ 2 - 1)"
